<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land in US236 mln China JV project.</title>
<headline>DBS Land in US236 mln China JV project.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Land Ltd said on Monday it was involved in the development of new residential and hotel projects in China, worth US$236 million.</p>
</text>
